-			 * search is not worthwhile. CFS would reach the same
-			 * conclusion, so skip select_idle_smt/select_idle_cpu.
-			 *
-			 * POC returns -1 for Level 0 saturation (no idle CPUs
-			 * in bitmap), but CFS may still find sched_idle CPUs,
